The '''Animalist Platform''' ({{Lang-bl|Platforma animalista}}) is a Baliscan [[W:Platformism|platform]] focused on {{W|total liberation}} (also known as veganarchism), [[W:Animal rights|animal rights]] and eliminating [[W:Cruelty to animals|cruelty to animals]]. 

